from __future__ import annotations

"""
utils_pkg/router.py — V3+++ God-Tier Router (LOCK-IN FINAL, probe-safe)
======================================================================

Primary goals
-------------
- Zero network / zero wallet I/O at import time.
- Pass P0 contract tests (tests/test_swap.py) AND scripts/check_router probe patterns.
- Pass offline sell-path contract (tests/sell_path_test.py):
    - get_sell_quote() must GET /quote with correct params (including userPublicKey)
    - swap_from_quote() must POST /swap with payload including quoteResponse + userPublicKey
    - DRYRUN/SAFE_MODE must NOT skip the /swap POST if a patched session is present.

Preserved production features
-----------------------------
- retries, cooldowns, caching, dryrun/no-network safety,
- lightning-first routing with optional direct swap fallback,
- budget hooks, routeguard hook,
- stable public APIs + probe-safe argument normalization.

P0 Contract
-----------
Module MUST expose:
  - get_buy_quote(...)
  - get_sell_quote(...)
  - get_quote(...)
  - swap_from_quote(...)

Preflight Contract (scripts/check_router.py)
--------------------------------------------
Must tolerate probe calls like:
  - get_quote(amount_sol=0.01, input_mint=..., output_mint=..., slippage_bps=...)
  - get_quote(amount=lamports, inputMint=..., outputMint=..., slippageBps=...)
  - get_buy_quote(amount_sol=0.01, mint=..., slippage_bps=...)
  - get_buy_quote(lamports_in=..., mint=..., slippageBps=...)
  - get_buy_quote(mint, 0.01, 200)         # positional drift
…and similar alias spellings.

No import-time network calls.
"""

